  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut potato into 0.5cm-thick rounds. <br>• Slice zucchini into thick rounds.<br>• Place potato and zucchini on a lined oven tray, <br>drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over garlic &amp; herb <br>seasoning and season with a pinch of salt and <br>pepper. Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast <br>until golden, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-b48ee400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion. <br>• Finely chop garlic. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-b8b57110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms and <br>onion, stirring, until tender, 3-5 minutes.<br>• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season <br>to taste with salt and pepper.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-bbef3020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Evenly stack 5 sheets of filo pastry with a drizzle of <br>olive oil between each layer and place on a second <br>lined oven tray.<br>• Top with roasted potatoes in centre of the pastry, <br>leaving a 4cm border around the edge.<br>• Top with roasted zucchini and mushroom mixture, <br>season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-30162330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the <br>centre exposed.<br>• Bake galette until golden, 15-20 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-93ecfe40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Just before serving, in a large bowl combine <br>spinach &amp; rocket mix with a drizzle of olive oil  <br>and vinegar. Season to taste.<br>• Slice mushroom, onion and potato filo galette,  <br>then divide between plates.<br>• Serve with spinach-rocket salad and a dollop of <br>chilli jam. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f91c80ad488c9bcf47a/step-33e38450.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
